{"Title":"An Act to establish free access to ride to elections in Massachusetts (FARE) ","BillNumber":"H3384","DocketNumber":"HD462","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"FAM1","Name":"Frank A. Moran","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/FAM1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-13T10:34:21.653"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"FAM1","Name":"Frank A. Moran","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/FAM1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-13T10:34:21.6533333"},{"Id":"V_H1","Name":"Vanna Howard","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/V_H1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-01T10:04:31.2166667"},{"Id":"SND0","Name":"Sal N. DiDomenico","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SND0","ResponseDate":"2023-02-07T12:55:47.0233333"},{"Id":"EAR1","Name":"Estela A. Reyes","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/EAR1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-08T13:56:32.12"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3384/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Moran of Lawrence, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3384) of Frank A. Moran and others for legislation to provide for free public transportation on state primary and election days.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tNotwithstanding any general or special law to the contrary, the Massachusetts Bay Transportation Authority and regional transit authorities organized under chapter 161B of the General Laws shall not charge riders a fare for rapid transit, bus, and trolleybus service along fixed routes on the day of a biennial state primary or biennial state general election. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}